## User

The largest of three natural numbers.

## Type

type
```bend
def max3(+a: Nat, +b: Nat, +c: Nat) -> Nat:
```

## Term

```bend
match a b c:
  case 0n _ _:
    b
  case 1n+p 0n _:
    1n+p
  case 1n+p 1n+q:
    max3(p, q, 1n+p)
```

